# A78 (our desktop, sd-base, no #Z): idle dump (the C:\ window is open at boot,
# fully on screen), arm the serial trace, drag it by its title bar (200,53) by
# (+30,+40): pure move of gl_wtop fully on screen -> desk/ answers WM_MOVED with
# wind_set(WF_CXYWH) -> w_move blits, no WM_REDRAW to the window.
# Ticks are 200 Hz after "[desk] desktop up" (A46 dual arming).
1100 mark A_IDLE
1200 park
1206 move 300 300
1400 arm
1500 move 200 53
1700 down
1750 drag 230 93
1850 up
1950 mark C_MOVED
2350 mark D_MOVED_2S
